## Description

Verdure is a practical document and image studio for scanning, adjusting, converting, compressing, and building PDF files on your iPhone or iPad.

Scan a document, clean up an image, convert between popular formats, or combine multiple pages into a polished PDF — all from one simple workspace.

DOCUMENT SCANNER

Turn physical documents into digital pages using your device camera. Verdure uses Apple's document scanning technology to detect document edges and help create clean, perspective-corrected scans.

• Scan documents with your camera
• Automatically detect document boundaries
• Create multi-page document stacks
• Review and remove scanned pages
• Build a PDF from multiple scanned pages

ADJUST & COMPRESS

Prepare images before sharing or exporting them. Choose from built-in looks and adjust the image to suit your needs.

• Original
• Scan Clean
• Bold Mono
• Rich Color
• Rotate left or right
• Mirror images horizontally
• Resize images
• Adjust JPEG compression quality
• Export and share your finished image

CONVERT FILES

Convert your images into commonly used formats with a straightforward workflow.

• Convert images to PNG
• Convert images to JPEG
• Create single-page PDFs
• Preserve transparency when exporting supported images as PNG
• Process files directly on your device
• Share exported files with other apps

PDF STUDIO

Create multi-page PDF documents from scanned pages or imported images.

• Combine multiple pages into one PDF
• Choose A4 or US Letter page size
• Portrait or landscape orientation
• Add an optional watermark
• Set a document title
• Preview and export your finished PDF
• Share your PDF wherever you need it

LIBRARY & HISTORY

Keep track of your recent work with a simple on-device library.

• View recent processed files
• See file information and size changes
• Review scanned and converted documents
• Keep your workflow organized

PRIVATE BY DESIGN

Verdure is designed around on-device file processing. Your documents and images can be processed directly on your device without requiring an online conversion service.

The app does not require an account to use its core file-processing features.

SIMPLE WORKFLOW

Choose what you need from one place:

Scan → Adjust → Convert → Build PDF → Share

Whether you're digitizing paperwork, preparing an image for sharing, compressing a JPEG, converting an image format, or assembling a multi-page document, Verdure keeps the workflow simple.

FEATURE HIGHLIGHTS

• Document scanning
• Multi-page PDF creation
• PNG, JPEG and PDF workflows
• Image filters and adjustments
• Image resizing
• JPEG compression
• A4 and US Letter PDF sizes
• Portrait and landscape PDF layouts
• Optional PDF watermark
• Recent file history
• On-device processing
• Share and export support

Verdure is built for everyday document and image tasks without unnecessary complexity.

